  "ruleText": "Lot 1001.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to set forth the provisions for how instant lottery game prizes are claimed and tickets are validated.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Lot 1000) #12747, eff 3-23-19",
